2. Fix it, cross-platform.
3. Run the full suite again.
4. Get a review: a second, independent Claude review of the diff.
5. Commit.
6. Add the `MAC-INBOX.md` entry.

Never touch a locked path: those go to the inbox as proposed diffs.

